# SUPERSEDED — DO NOT RELY ON THIS FILE FOR DEPLOYMENT SAFETY
#
# This example deny-list was an interim idea for publish = ".".
# Ignore/deny lists are incomplete protection: anything not listed can still
# ship, and private folders must never depend on an ignore file alone.
#
# Do not copy this to .netlifyignore as a security control.
#
# Active secure publishing pipeline:
#   - scripts/build-public.mjs  (explicit allowlist of public files only)
#   - root netlify.toml         (build → publish = "dist")
#   - dist/                     (generated public output; gitignored)
#
